    <books>{
      # Vector Spine

      The Vector Spine was the geometric navigation lattice shared across all Helios fleet vessels.

      ## Components

      | Component | Purpose |
      |---|---|
      | Spine Nodes | Spatial anchor points |
      | Transit Threads | Predicted route vectors |
      | Gravity Wells | Dynamic hazard markers |
      | Fold Gates | High-speed route shortcuts |

      ```netiv
      °define •spineMode: •string = "predictive lattice";
      °define •spineRender: •string = "books content can carry code blocks";
      ```

      ## Incident Behavior

      - vessel route maps no longer matched
      - predictive overlays conflicted
      - emergency routing loops formed
      - several support ships became isolated

      ## Historical Impact

      Modern interstellar systems now isolate navigation consensus layers to avoid recursive amplification failures.
    };
